$comment
TS01: SN2 identity reaction Cl- + CH3Cl -> ClCH3 + Cl- at
B3LYP/6-311+G(d,p). Q-Chem JOBTYPE = ts computes an initial Hessian
automatically. Expect 1 imaginary mode (~400i cm-1, antisymm Cl-C-Cl).
$end

$molecule
-1 1
Cl  0.000000   0.000000  -2.400000
C   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
Cl  0.000000   0.000000   2.400000
H   1.026719   0.000000   0.000000
H  -0.513360   0.889165   0.000000
H  -0.513360  -0.889165   0.000000
$end

$rem
   JOBTYPE   ts
   METHOD    b3lyp
   BASIS    6-311+G(d,p)
$end

@@@

$molecule
   READ
$end

